  m_Name: NPCDialog2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarrationLines
  lines:
  - Good Job on completing the second phase of training employee.
  - We're satisfied with your work...
  - But it needs a little improvement.
  - We'll put a pin in that for now...
  - For the final phase of training we have some employees-
  - ' who have not met our caompany standard.'
  - We need you to "let them go".
  - Here's an upgrade to your gun. Good Luck.
